{
 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "c03-title-01",
   "scene": "c03-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Chapter three.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "title"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-title-02",
   "scene": "c03-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "With the pronoun for me, the ending is hidden.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "ar:ـي"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-hidden-01",
   "scene": "c03-hidden",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The pronoun for me always needs a kasra before it.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "b:0",
    "ar:ـي#2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-hidden-02",
   "scene": "c03-hidden",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "So the noun cannot show damma, fatha or kasra of its own.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-hidden-03",
   "scene": "c03-hidden",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "My book is new.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "b:1",
    "ex:0"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-hidden-04",
   "scene": "c03-hidden",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "كِتَابِي جَدِيدٌ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:كِتَابِي جَدِيدٌ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-hidden-05",
   "scene": "c03-hidden",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The word for book is the Topic, and it is rafʿ. But you see a kasra.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "note:0",
    "ar:كِتَابِ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-hidden-06",
   "scene": "c03-hidden",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The pen is in my book.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "ex:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-hidden-07",
   "scene": "c03-hidden",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "القَلَمُ فِي كِتَابِي",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:القَلَمُ فِي كِتَابِي"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-hidden-08",
   "scene": "c03-hidden",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Here the word for book is jarr. It looks the same.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "note:1",
    "ar:كِتَابِ#2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-rule-01",
   "scene": "c03-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "So here is the rule. Do not read the ending before the pronoun for me.",
   "pause": 0.35,
   "cues": [
    "b:0",
    "ar:ـي#2",
    "hl:Do not read the ending before"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-rule-02",
   "scene": "c03-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Before it, the kasra is for the pronoun.",
   "pause": 0.35,
   "cues": [
    "ar:ـي#3",
    "hl:the kasra is for the pronoun"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-rule-03",
   "scene": "c03-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Find the job of the noun from the sentence, never from this vowel.",
   "pause": 0.7,
   "cues": [
    "hl:from the sentence, never from this vowel"
   ]
  }
 ]
}